# Public site URL (used for canonical links, sitemap, robots, and OG metadata).
# Set this to your production domain. Used by lib/site.ts as BASE_URL.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://123tool.app

# Base URL for large static assets that are kept out of the deployment bundle:
# the Khmer OCR ONNX models (~55 MB) and the Coeng Ta/Da WASM (~2.5 MB). Used by
# lib/assets.ts. Leave unset to use the built-in default (jsDelivr, pinned to a
# commit of this public repo). Override to point at your own host — e.g. a
# Vercel Blob store or Cloudflare R2 bucket — with the same /models and /vendor
# path layout. Must be CORS-enabled for in-browser fetch. No trailing slash.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSETS_BASE_URL=https://cdn.example.com/tools123-assets
